<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  SYNTHETIC — not emitted by Fluxtion.

  The instance ids match sample.yml so the pair-check and step-through can be exercised against a real
  log, but the EDGES AND CLASS NAMES ARE INVENTED. The wiring is therefore NOT the real processor's
  dispatch order, and this file must not be used to illustrate what a real graph looks like.

  Fine for tests (parsing and classification do not care whether the wiring is realistic). Replace with
  the processor's actual emitted .graphml before using it in documentation.
-->
